# The holds: the knobs play something else while a key or FX is held, on any page.
# A drone key held: the knobs shape that voice (LEVEL, TONE, DETUNE, OCTAVE), it stays so, and the key
# does not latch it; tapped, it latches. With ALGO it comes and goes instead (SWELL): a tap swells it in,
# then it falls away by itself; a latched one switched so swells out. FX held: THROWS (shimmer, feedback, freeze, dip); let go, they
# drift back; SAVE while holding keeps them, until FX is held and turned again. A white key held (PLAY):
# BENDS VOX (bright, vibrato, shimmer, release); let go, back; SAVE while holding puts them into VOX's
# sound. Audio in holds.wav.
autoplay 0
wait 300
wav holds.wav
key b1 down
wait 100
turn K1 -10
turn K4 1
wait 100
expect dvoice21 86
expect dvoice24 2
shot hold_drone.png
key b1 up
wait 100
expect drone2 0
tapkey b1
wait 100
expect drone2 1
key b3 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 1
key b3 up
wait 100
expect dswell 8
expect drone4 0
expect set_bpm 90
tapkey b3
wait 300
expect drone4 1
wait 8000
expect drone4 0
key b1 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 1
key b1 up
wait 6000
expect dswell 10
expect drone2 0
press FX
wait 100
turn K1 10
wait 100
expect perf0 40
shot hold_fx.png
release FX
wait 100
expect view 0
wait 2500
expect perf0 0
press FX
wait 100
turn K3 20
wait 100
tap SAVE
release FX
wait 3000
expect perf2 80
expect view 0
shot throw_kept.png
press FX
wait 100
turn K3 -20
release FX
wait 100
expect perf2 0
key w3 down
wait 100
turn K1 6
wait 100
expect perf4 12
shot hold_bend.png
key w3 up
wait 2500
expect perf4 0
key w3 down
wait 100
turn K1 6
turn K2 5
wait 100
tap SAVE
key w3 up
wait 100
expect shape21 76
expect shape25 30
expect perf4 0
expect perf5 0
tapkey b1
wait 30000
wavstop
expect clips 0
